.el .ds Aq '
.TH maw-install 1  "maw-install " 
.SH NAME
maw\-install \- install packages, record them in maw.nix, scaffold their modules, then activate
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmaw install\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPACKAGES\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
install packages, record them in maw.nix, scaffold their modules, then activate
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
print what would change without changing anything
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPACKAGES\fR>
names or flatpak app ids, or cargo:<crate|git url>, go:<path>, uv:<pypi name|git url>, npm:<package>, flatpak:<app id>, xbps:<name>; @version pins
.SH EXTRA
see: maw help installing
